ong>runes</strong> and improve your <strong>stats</strong>. <strong>Stats</strong> increase with the quality of the <strong>rune</strong> !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wave :</strong>\u00a0By finishing one wave, you will be able to buy skill\u00a0<strong>scrolls</strong> or <strong>stats scrolls.</strong> Skill scrolls will level up your skills and stats scroll will give you multiple stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helcoins and market :</strong> By surviving or dying, you will get 1 helcoins per enemy killed, which can be useful to buy <strong>permanent bonuses in the market</strong>.</p></li></ul>","developers":["GRAIJE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836140/f848489d7afa422541097da23f5319880e922f26/header.jpg?t=1753448812","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836140/178718892/f6aecb571a64f5961889c157c0561623299747df/1751027439/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752236917","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836140/178718892/f6aecb571a64f5961889c157c0561623299747df/1751027439/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752236917","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836140/178718892/f6aecb571a64f5961889c157c0561623299747df/1751027439/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752236917","id":257162377,"name":"Yggdrasil Defenders Early Access","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162377/f999658b34eae5431efdd901a9a73122c56